<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ GROUP NET RISES IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ GROUP NET RISES IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.86 vs   0.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.14 vs   0.60</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.59 vs   0.01</p>
<p> Sales		   12.75 vs   2.62</p>
